<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.5in">Emerging growth company&#160;<span id="xdx_90A_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20240325__20240325_zPXwoEjZyUtk" style="font-family: Wingdings"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2024-03-25" format="ixt:booleanfalse" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany" id="ixv-386">&#168;</ix:nonNumeric></span></p>

